1>Build toward<br><span class=\"sc-gradient\">a $24,000 month.</span></h1><p>The next Scrolly Club is taking shape: practical organic-growth direction for businesses ready to work toward a bigger goal.</p><div class=\"sc-actions\"><a class=\"sc-btn sc-btn-light\" href=\"#launch\">Get launch details</a><a class=\"sc-btn sc-btn-ghost\" href=\"/24k-challenge/\">Explore the Challenge</a></div><p class=\"sc-small\">Revenue figures are goals, not guaranteed results.</p></div><div class=\"sc-goalboard\"><div class=\"sc-board-label\">Your next revenue goal</div><div class=\"sc-number\">$24K</div><div class=\"sc-stripes\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class=\"sc-board-bottom\">Build → Grow → Earn Your Stripes<div class=\"sc-board-path\"><span>$1K</span><span>→ $10K</span><span>→ $24K</span></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"sc-section \" ><div class=\"sc-wrap\"><div class=\"sc-intro\"><span class=\"sc-eyebrow\">The direction</span><h2>A useful next step for your business.</h2><p>This is a preview of the direction. Detailed features and enrollment terms will be published before launch.</p></div><div class=\"sc-grid\"><article class=\"sc-card\"><div class=\"sc-num\">01</div><h3>Find opportunities</h3><p>Identify organic-growth opportunities that fit your business and stage.</p></article><article class=\"sc-card\"><div class=\"sc-num\">02</div><h3>Put ideas to work</h3><p>Turn the next growth priorities into practical actions.</p></article><article class=\"sc-card\"><div class=\"sc-num\">03</div><h3>Learn as you go</h3><p>Review what you tried and use real results to inform the next step.</p></article></div></div></section><section class=\"sc-section sc-white\" id=\"club-vs-challenge\"><div class=\"sc-wrap\"><div class=\"sc-intro\"><span class=\"sc-eyebrow\">Choose your way forward</span><h2>Club or Challenge?</h2><p>Start with your goal. Then choose how you want to work toward it.</p></div><div class=\"sc-grid sc-grid-2\"><article class=\"sc-card\"><h3>Club: build your approach</h3><p>Practical guidance, marketing ideas, and tools to help you decide what to try for your business. Work through the opportunities at your own pace.</p></article><article class=\"sc-card\"><h3>Challenge: put it into action</h3><p>A focused attempt with a defined goal, actions to try, and progress to review. The $1K Challenge is planned around 30 days.</p></article></div><div class=\"sc-note\"><p>All six Club and Challenge offers are coming soon. They are separate offers; access, requirements, and final inclusions will be confirmed before enrollment opens.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"sc-section \" ><div class=\"sc-wrap\"><div class=\"sc-intro\"><span class=\"sc-eyebrow\">Who it is for</span><h2>For owners ready to do the work.</h2><p>You have an offer, or one close to launch, and want practical ways to reach buyers. Scrolly supports your work; outcomes depend on your business, market, and execution.</p></div><div class=\"sc-note\"><p>No sales, profit, or timing outcome is guaranteed. The $24K figure describes a revenue goal, not the price of this offer.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"sc-section sc-white\" ><div class=\"sc-wrap\"><div class=\"sc-intro\"><span class=\"sc-eyebrow\">A few useful answers</span><h2>Before you join.</h2></div><div class=\"sc-faq\"><details><summary>Can I buy $24K Club today?</summary><p>No. $24K Club is coming soon and is not open for purchase. Request launch news below.</p></details><details><summary>Is $24K a guaranteed outcome?</summary><p>No. It is a revenue goal. Revenue is not profit, and results vary with your offer, customers, market, and execution.</p></details><details><summary>What will it cost and include?</summary><p>Final pricing, features, access terms, and support will be confirmed before checkout opens.</p></details><details><summary>Can I use the existing SEO tools meanwhile?</summary><p>Yes. Explore the <a href=\"/digital-products/\">Shopify and Pinterest workbooks</a> or the <a href=\"/seo-tools/\">SEO Audit and Implementation services</a>.</p></details></div></div></section><section class=\"sc-banner\" id=\"launch\"><div class=\"sc-wrap\"><span class=\"sc-eyebrow\">Next up</span><h2>$24K Club is coming soon.</h2><p>Enrollment is not open yet. Request launch news by email, or use our contact form to ask a question. Final features, pricing, and launch details will be confirmed before checkout opens.</p><div class=\"sc-actions\"><a class=\"sc-btn sc-btn-light\" href=\"mailto:hello@scrollyseo.com?subject=Launch%20updates%3A%20%2424K%20Club&body=Hi%20Scrolly%2C%20please%20let%20me%20know%20when%20%2424K%20Club%20is%20ready%20to%20launch.%20Thank%20you!\">Request launch news</a><a class=\"sc-btn sc-btn-ghost\" href=\"/contact/\">Contact Scrolly</a></div><p class=\"sc-small\">The launch-news button opens your email app. Your request is sent only when you send the email.</p></div></section></div><!-- /wp:html -->",
